      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n3. As has been earlier indited by this Court, one of the main reasons why the food articles in question become poisonous is because those are not consumed within the time frames it is intended for."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "884c852f5a064ae39b7db37349e79861_14",
